[38;2;124;124;124mthe restriction of G₁ to the forcing below λ) has size < λ and is in M₁. The [0m
[38;2;124;124;124minfimum of j[G₁ ↾ λ] in P₁ exists (by the closure of the forcing), giving a [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mmaster condition q. We then build a generic filter H₁ containing q ∪ j[G₁] over [0m[38;2;124;124;124mM₁, and extend j to j: V₁[G₁] → M₁[H₁].[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe closure M₁[H₁]^λ ⊆ M₁[H₁] follows from M₁^λ ⊆ M₁ and the fact that P₁ is λ-[0m
